ccess = bind the **Tailscale interface + shared-secret token** on mutating `/api/*`.\n\n**Provenance**\n- Decisions are recorded as driven by adversarial Crucible findings; the member set comprises the Master Plan, Implementation Plan (Foreman-ready), Execution Log, and Decision Log.\n\n*Note: claims above are limited to terms present in the supplied member-document anchors; lane/wave implementation detail beyond these anchors was not asserted.*"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4310,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24583,"cache_read_input_tokens":20597,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24583},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b6d17723-62a8-4830-9378-f233f58d1ea3","uuid":"b2a0afdf-082c-4683-914b-3af209a5c1c7","request_id":"req_011Cc1hWzxiq1UsNhY1YGB6f"}
